{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Photo Eraser for iPhone 是一款專為 iPhone 用家而設的照片修補工具，適合想快速去除畫面雜物、改善照片觀感的人士。它運用 InPaint 演算法，讓用家以紅色標記要移除的範圍，再自動修復背景；目前正以原價 US $0.99 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>提供。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-236.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>快速清除多餘物件</h2>\n<p>使用時只需以紅色標記想清除的區域，Photo Eraser for iPhone 便會自動修補背景，可處理水印、日期印章、文字、簽名、多餘人物及皮膚瑕疵等。整個流程無需專業修圖知識，適合日常整理相片，並聲稱可在數秒至數分鐘內完成，讓照片看起來更自然。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2208\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2208bb.jpg\" width=\"1242\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2208\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2208bb-1.jpg\" width=\"1242\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2208\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2208bb-2.jpg\" width=\"1242\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2208\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2208bb-3.jpg\" width=\"1242\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Photo Eraser for iPhone</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/photo-eraser-for-iphone/id646256209?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.707717+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:56:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T17:32:03.612109+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:23.910778+00:00","content_hash":"a7b26ad6b29cbdefabbf0924e3d98d4b11ba2e29d73c75ceae5350a8bce10b6c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}